Data Washing Machine Classic + CODA Comparator - attribution and terms

1. Upstream source

   This repository contains software derived from the Data Washing Machine
   refactor maintained on Bitbucket:

   https://bitbucket.org/oysterer/dwm-refactor-v1

   The original authors retain all rights to their work. Use, redistribution,
   and modification of upstream portions must follow the license and terms
   published with that project. If no license is shown there, treat those
   portions as subject to the original authors' copyright and obtain appropriate
   permission before use beyond what the law allows.

2. Modifications in this repository

   Changes and additions made in this GitHub fork include data-capture
   utilities, driver/reporting integration, per-iteration blocking metrics,
   benchmark runners, the cleaned Colab bundle, and CODA/TahaComparator-CX
   comparator documentation and implementation. Contributors to those
   modifications should be credited when you cite or reuse this repository.

3. Attribution

   When you publish or redistribute material from this repository, cite both:

